<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SEE THE BIGGER PICTURE</p><h1>Trends</h1><p>Explore your cash flow, spending patterns, and net worth over time.</p></div></div><section class="card"><%= render 'transactions/filters', destination: trends_path, from: @from, to: @to, currency: @currency, report: true %></section>
<div class="summary-grid"><section class="card metric"><p>Income</p><strong class="positive"><%= money(@report.income, @currency) %></strong></section><section class="card metric"><p>Spending</p><strong><%= money(@report.spending, @currency) %></strong></section><section class="card metric"><p>Net cash flow</p><strong><%= money(@report.income - @report.spending, @currency) %></strong></section></div>
<div class="overview-grid"><%= render 'spending' %></div>
<section class="card padded"><h2>Net worth history · observed valuations</h2><p class="muted">Transaction filters apply to cash-flow charts only. Net worth uses the date range and currency across tracked accounts.</p><p>Uses only saved bank snapshots and dated asset valuations. Each point carries forward the last observed value; missing history is never inferred from transactions. Coverage shows how many tracked accounts/assets have a known value on that date.</p><% if @history.any? %><% values = @history.map { |row| row[1].to_f }; low, high = values.minmax; spread = [high - low, 1].max; points = values.each_with_index.map { |value, i| "#{20 + i * 660.0 / [values.size - 1, 1].max},#{170 - (value - low) * 140.0 / spread}" }.join(' ') %><svg class="history-chart" viewBox="0 0 700 200" role="img" aria-label="Net worth at saved observation dates; exact amounts and coverage listed below"><line x1="20" y1="180" x2="680" y2="180" stroke="#dce5e2"/><polyline points="<%= points %>" fill="none" stroke="#008d82" stroke-width="3"/><% points.split.each do |point| %><% x,y = point.split(',') %><circle cx="<%= x %>" cy="<%= y %>" r="4" fill="#008d82"/><% end %></svg><p class="muted">Observation points are evenly spaced; gaps between observations may vary.</p><% end %><div class="table-scroll"><table class="responsive-table" role="table" aria-label="Net worth observations"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Observation date</th><th scope="col">Known net worth</th><th scope="col">Coverage</th></tr></thead><tbody><% @history.each do |date, value, known, total, known_assets, assets| %><tr><td data-label="Observation date"><%= date %></td><td data-label="Known net worth"><%= money(value, @currency) %></td><td data-label="Coverage"><%= known %>/<%= total %> bank accounts · <%= known_assets %>/<%= assets %> manual assets<%= ' · Partial history' if known < total || known_assets < assets %></td></tr><% end %><% if @history.empty? %><tr><td colspan="3" class="empty-state">No observed valuations in this range. CSV history does not create balance history.</td></tr><% end %></tbody></table></div></section>
